From: Matheus Biolowons <30575805+Ashu11-A@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:53:26 -0300
Subject: core: altera X-Frame-Options para SAMEORIGIN no pré-visualizador de tema

Description:
Substitui o valor do cabeçalho HTTP X-Frame-Options de DENY para SAMEORIGIN
no middleware SetSecurityHeaders, permitindo que o iframe de pré-visualização
da página administrativa de temas renderize telas da mesma origem sem ser
bloqueado pelo navegador.

Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
Applied-Upstream: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-27
Signed-off-by: Matheus Biolowons <30575805+Ashu11-A@users.noreply.github.com>

---

diff --git a/app/Http/Middleware/SetSecurityHeaders.php b/app/Http/Middleware/SetSecurityHeaders.php
index 1a9c5ddd3..afc2bf543 100644
--- a/app/Http/Middleware/SetSecurityHeaders.php
+++ b/app/Http/Middleware/SetSecurityHeaders.php
@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@ class SetSecurityHeaders
      * by the admin to support those cases without too much trouble.
      */
     private static array $headers = [
-        'X-Frame-Options' => 'DENY',
+        'X-Frame-Options' => 'SAMEORIGIN',
         'X-Content-Type-Options' => 'nosniff',
         'X-XSS-Protection' => '1; mode=block',
         'Referrer-Policy' => 'no-referrer-when-downgrade',
